 Execute end-to-end campaigns from strategy brief, to campaign build, QA, and launch.

 Manage cross-functional relationships with product marketing, operations, and product partners to lead the channel communications strategy for DoorDash for Business programs, including testing, iteration, and scaling.

 Manage the campaign strategy end to end. Includes driving the creative review process, collaborating with designers and copywriters, identifying target audience segments and capturing feedback from multiple stakeholders.

 Analyze campaign results, develop benchmarks, and create and share regular performance reports.

 Align with partner teams regularly to share best practices and insights.


