 4-6+ years of experience in marketing or growth overall; 3+ years of experience in lifecycle, email, CRM, or retention marketing. Experience working in B2B / B2B2C a plus;

 Deep familiarity with CRM platforms (e.g. Braze, Iterable, Salesforce Marketing Cloud) and experience executing across email, push, SMS, and in-app channels;

 A strong test-and-learn orientation and analytical skills — you run structured experiments, interpret results clearly, and use them to prioritize what to do next;

